    "text": "Wurmes of \u00feine fl\u00e6sce.\n\u00deu scalt fostren \u00feine feond \u00feet \u00feu beo al ifreten, \u00feu scalt nu herborwen unhol wihte.\nNoldest \u00feu \u00e6r gode men for lufe god d\u00e6lan.\nHeo wulle\u00fe wurchen hore hord on \u00feine heauedponne, nulle\u00fe heo bileafen \u00feine lippen unfreten.\nAc \u00feu scalt grisliche grennien ond gristbitien, hwo so hit iseige, he mihte beon offered.\nReowliche bi\u00fe so \u00fein si\u00fe efter \u00fein wrecche lif.\nNu me wule swopen \u00feine flor ond \u00feet flet clensien, for hit is ham lo\u00fere, \u00fee \u00feu \u00feeron leige.\nHeo wulle\u00fe mid holi watere beworpen ec \u00feeo w\u00e6de, bletsien ham georne to burewen ham wi\u00fe \u00fee,\n\u00deus \u00feu ert nu ilufed, seo\u00fe\u00feen \u00feu me forlure.\nAl hit is reowliche \u00fein si\u00fe efter \u00fein wrecche lif.\nGet s\u00e6i\u00fe \u00fee soule soriliche to hire licame, wendest \u00feu la, erming her o to wunienne?\nNes hit \u00fee nowiht icunde \u00feet \u00feu icoren hefdest?\nNes hit icunde \u00fee more \u00feen \u00feine cunne biuoren \u00fee?\nNe heold ic \u00fein eigen opene, \u00feeo hwule ic \u00fee inne was?\nHwi noldest \u00feu lefen, \u00fea \u00feu hit iseige, hu \u00fein foref\u00e6deres ferden biforen \u00fee?\nNu heo wunie\u00fe on eor\u00fee, wurmes ham habbe\u00fe tod\u00e6led, iscend hore sorhfulle bones, \u00fee \u00feeo sunne\n\u00dea get sei\u00fe \u00feeo soule soriliche to hire licame, \u00e6fre \u00feu were lu\u00feer, \u00feeo hwile \u00feu lif h\u00e6fdest.\n\u00deu were leas ond luti ond unriht lufedest.\nOnd mid worde ond mid werke, so \u00feu wurst mihtest.\nIc com from gode clene to \u00fee isend, ac \u00feu hauest unc fordon mid \u00feine lu\u00feere deden.\n\u00c6fre \u00feu were gredi ond mid gromen \u00fee onfulled.\nUnnea\u00fee ic on \u00fee eni wununge h\u00e6fde for hearde ni\u00fee ond ofermete fulle, for \u00fein wombe was \u00fein god\nForloren \u00feu hauest \u00feeo ece bli